  "Answer": {
    "Title": "Add store_test_results and store_artifacts",
    "Explanation": [
      "The run step writes the JUnit XML to ~/project/results/test_results.xml, as the log line 'Wrote ~/project/results/test_results.xml' shows. The step then ends with 'exit 1', so the job is red (exit status 1). The config has no store_test_results step, so nothing appears in the Tests tab. It also has no store_artifacts step, so nothing appears in the Artifacts tab. Removing 'exit 1' alone would make the job green, but it would still upload nothing. Adding only one of the two store steps would meet only half of the requirement. The fix is to add both steps after the run step: '- store_test_results: path: ~/project/results' and '- store_artifacts: path: ~/project/results/test_results.xml'. Because the run step currently fails, add 'when: always' to both steps (or remove the deliberate 'exit 1') so the uploads are not skipped after the failure."
